OL,3,GNEWSAM5 fully closed following
OL,4,Atwo-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M5 has been shut in both directions
OL,7,Fin Somerset after a crash involving two
OL,8,Fvehicles.
OL,10,FNational Highways said traffic had been
OL,11,Fstopped between junction 25 at Taunton
OL,12,Fand junction 24 at Bridgwater.
OL,14,FAvon and Somerset Police said one
OL,15,Fperson had been airlifted to hospital
OL,16,Fand other emergency services were at
OL,17,Fthe scene.
OL,19,FDrivers have been advised to use
OL,20,Falternative routes. However, roads
OL,21,Fthrough North Petherton into Bridgwater
OL,22,Fare reportedly already very busy.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
